tions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-02-10T04:37:51Z","updated_at":"2026-06-29T04:20:43Z","closed_at":"2026-04-17T02:50:27Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.5 -> 4.6 (versions supporting macOS game mode embedding)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - macOS Tahoe (26.2.0) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 (Apple7) - Apple M1 (8 threads) - 16.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThere seems to be an error with how the embedded game mode renders when using Metal. Most clearly, there are scaling artifacting issues present when looking at text or other UI elements. These issues go away when you don't use embedded game mode, or when you switch the renderer to Vulkan. Issues not present on Windows or Linux editors.\n\nPlease view these images as large as you can to see the issue - text and UI elements show improper scaling and clipping.\n\n**EMBEDDED:**\n<img width=\"1955\" height=\"1169\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2b457818-580a-434a-a840-2a2942ee6d10\" />\n\n**NOT EMBEDDED:**\n<img width=\"1940\" height=\"1132\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca749ae4-cd56-415b-8040-099ca963a157\" />\n\n**EMBEDDED:**\n<img width=\"1957\" height=\"1182\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/21c1e339-6853-4ca0-b629-40a64cd0421b\" />\n\n**NOT EMBEDDED:**\n<img width=\"2049\" height=\"1227\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/91314069-7510-4882-83b0-0744d096803e\" />\n\nChanging scaling modes gives no improvement.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create new project\n- Stretch mode set to canvas_items\n- Aspect set to expand\n- hiDPI enabled\n- Create Control scene with text or other assets visible\n- Run the scene in embedded, and again without embedding to compare\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MetalScalingBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25199480/MetalScalingBug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116120/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116120/timeline","performe